  "description": "meme-id: gangster_gettig_shot; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The meme juxtaposes a violent scene of a gangster being shot with a close-up of a man in a fedora, using the text 'gangster gettig shot' (likely a misspelling of 'getting shot'). The intent is to create a humorous or ironic effect by contrasting the dramatic, violent imagery with the mundane or unimpressed expression of the man in the bottom panel. While not explicitly targeting any protected group, the content is harmful because it trivializes violence and death through comedic juxtaposition, potentially desensitizing viewers to real-world violence. The meme does not contain direct abusive, cyberbullying, hateful, misogynistic, or propagandistic elements, but its normalization of graphic violence for comedic effect can be considered harmful in context.",
